❗️ The Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continue to carry out strikes using unmanned aerial vehicles against energy infrastructure facilities in Ukraine and vessels involved in supporting the AFU.

💥 In the daytime, the strikes hit:

▫️ the Kamenskaya 330 kV substation, which provided power to defence industry enterprises in Dnepropetrovsk region;

▫️ in the port of Chernomorsk (Odessa region), a container ship that had delivered dual-use equipment and cargo to Ukraine;

▫️ in the Black Sea, south-west of Odessa, a dry cargo ship carrying weapons and military equipment for the AFU.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry

